mp in performance but in reality  you're not spending all the time all day  exporting you're doing the edits in real  time to the photos and between those two  there's not really a difference actually  if i remember correctly there was a  difference the more expensive model was  actually louder because it's using more  wattage so that's an even bigger plus  for that base model so with all of that  said i do not think that most people  should be upgrading to the unbanned  model just save your money and spend it  on something else like an ssd storage  upgrade or you could upgrade the ram  from 16 gigs to 32 gigs and that might  actually give you a real difference and  that is exactly what we're gonna be  testing in our next video and by the  time you're watching right now that  video may already be done so check right  over there and if it is definitely watch  that video and if you're not already  subscribed click the circle above to  enter that giveaway don't forget to  comment down below guys thanks for  watching and we will see you in the next  video  [Music]
 

